      "created_at": "2015-08-27T04:02:20.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>So, we were just playing a game (on Steam) against Plague Rat in the Pike Industrial Complex, and it turned into the slowest Plague Rat game I've ever seen.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The Environment got two Checmical Explosions, and then two Biomemetic Plasma Vats, two Supercooled Trisolven Vats, and three rats before getting an Irridated Cyclohexane Vat.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Which meant that all non-irreducible damage was at -2, everyone healed 2 hp a turn, and very little damage was dealt. &nbsp;And the only infected hero was Mr. Fixer, who had Mantis out. &nbsp;So the game took a while.</p>",
