      "created_at": "2015-08-28T01:05:21.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Yes, but we were lucky that we had Expat, Ra, and Mr. Fixer on our side. &nbsp;There's not a lot of heros that can repeatably push out the kind of damage we needed to deal to whittle Plague Rat down. &nbsp;And if we'd been hit by that 7+ damage Checmical Explosion? &nbsp;That would have hurt badly.</p>",
